description: RAG must go through Retriever; keep originals for Neo4j migration
globs: "**/rag/**/*.py,**/ai/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

# RAG Retriever boundary

- All retrieval/ingest goes through `Retriever` + `get_retriever()` — never raw pgvector SQL in routes/tools
- Keep uploaded originals (`documents.storage_path`) so Neo4j/graph RAG can re-ingest later
- Stable `Passage` shape: text, score, source_doc_id, metadata
- `RETRIEVER_BACKEND=pgvector` for v1; do not add Neo4j until explicitly requested
